#
# What the image builds leave out of their context, the repository root
# (deploy/server/Dockerfile and deploy/postgres/Dockerfile). Each build
# installs its own dependencies, so no node_modules, build output or secret
# goes in.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
deploy/secrets
.env
.env.*
